---
description: Architecture package boundaries
alwaysApply: true
---

TypeScript + pnpm workspaces. Domain logic in `@reposetup/core`. Registry in `@reposetup/registry`. Integration definitions in `@reposetup/integrations`. CLI UI in `@reposetup/cli`. Integrations generate typed operations only. Only the executor may spawn processes or mutate files. `@reposetup/core` must not depend on Commander, Inquirer, Ink, React, or Firebase.
